TI  - Evaluating the safety of glucagon-like peptide-1 agonist use in non-diabetic overweight patients undergoing shoulder arthroplasty.
AU  - Hummel Amelia
AU  - Acuña Alexander J
AU  - Hornung Alexander
AU  - Lew Ryan
AU  - Harkin William
