TI  - Glucagon-like Peptide-1 Receptor Agonist Therapy Is Associated With Fewer Medical Complications After Carpal Tunnel Release in Diabetic Patients.
AU  - Hiredesai Annika N
AU  - Howlett Carina P
AU  - Kisiel Sara
AU  - Unadkat Krishna
